Subject: programs: titles without the project name

Command Prompt, File Manager, Help, WordPad, Mines, the uninstaller and
a few command line helps drop the project name from what they show.
---
diff --git a/programs/cmd/cmd.rc b/programs/cmd/cmd.rc
index bc738fa..af1ad53 100644
--- a/programs/cmd/cmd.rc
+++ b/programs/cmd/cmd.rc
@@ -219,7 +219,7 @@ To create or modify an environment variable the syntax is:\n\
 where <variable> and <value> are character strings. There must be no space\n\
 before the equals sign, nor can the variable name have embedded spaces.\n\
 \n\
-Under Wine, the environment of the underlying operating system is included\n\
+Under Raye, the environment of the underlying operating system is included\n\
 into the Win32 environment, there will generally therefore be many more\n\
 values than in a native Win32 implementation. Note that it is not possible\n\
 to affect the operating system environment from within cmd.\n"
@@ -246,7 +246,7 @@ VERIFY ON\tSet the flag.\n\
 VERIFY OFF\tClear the flag.\n\
 VERIFY\t\tDisplays ON or OFF as appropriate.\n\
 \n\
-The verify flag has no function in Wine.\n"
+The verify flag has no function in Raye.\n"
 
   WCMD_VER,
 "VER displays the version of cmd you are running.\n"
@@ -388,7 +388,7 @@ Enter HELP <command> for further information on any of the above commands.\n"
   WCMD_VOLUMESERIALNO, "Volume Serial Number is %1!04x!-%2!04x!\n\n"
   WCMD_VOLUMEPROMPT, "Volume label (11 characters, <Enter> for none)?"
   WCMD_ANYKEY,"Press any key to continue... "
-  WCMD_CONSTITLE,"Wine Command Prompt"
+  WCMD_CONSTITLE,"Command Prompt"
   WCMD_VERSION,"Microsoft Windows %1!S!\n"
   WCMD_MOREPROMPT, "More? "
   WCMD_LINETOOLONG, "The input line is too long.\n"
